<title>BELGIUM: EU committee to meet on lira Saturday.</title>
<headline>EU committee to meet on lira Saturday.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's monetary committee will meet at one p.m. (1200 gmt) on Saturday to discuss Italy's request to return the lira to the EU's exchange rate mechanism, an EU diplomat said on Friday.  </p>
<p>&quot;The meeting will take place at one o'clock,&quot; the diplomat said, referring to the local time in Brussels.</p>
<p>Throughout the day, Italian officials have said that they were poised to bring the lira back into the ERM after a four-year absence.</p>
<p>The lira was forced out of the mechanism in September 1992 by massive market pressure.</p>
<p>Rome is keen to bring it's currency back into the fold in order to qualify for the single European currency in 1999.</p>
</text>
